    "note": "\"Media Buzz\" isn't a stats projection - it's a measure of how consistently the fantasy football media is independently flagging a player as a 2026 breakout, sleeper, or league-winner pick. Each of our 168 drafted skill-position players was checked against 24 real 2026 sleeper/breakout/league-winner articles published between May and August 2026 across 13 outlets. Only players flagged by at least 2 distinct outlets are included here - a player named once by a single site (even in a list format that names them more than once, e.g. a \"10 experts pick a sleeper\" grid) isn't a consistent signal, just one outlet's opinion. The score is the total mention count across all qualifying outlets - more mentions means more of the industry is independently betting on a leap. Ties are broken by real market ADP (the earlier-drafted player ranks higher). Players outside this list aren't necessarily short on upside - they just weren't flagged consistently enough by this particular batch of coverage."
  },
